say: Euclid's Elements. <pause> Book One, Proposition One. <pause> [sfx:segment] Given a finite segment A B,

[screen: GOAL]
show: / A B /, / C A /, / C B /, < A B C >
active: < A B C >
equal: / A B /, / C A /, / C B /
symbolic: equilateral_triangle(/ A B /) → < A B C >
clause: equilateral_triangle(/ A B /) → < A B C > : / C A / = / A B / = / B C /
just: G.17 • I.1 | equilateral_triangle(/ A B /) → < A B C >
say: [sfx:qed] construct an equilateral triangle A B C upon it. <pause>

