clause: segment(C, A) → / C A / | segment(C, B) → / C B /
just: G.14 • I.Post.1 | segment(pt, pt)
say: [sfx:segment] and join segments C A and C B. <pause>

=== demonstration ===
[bell:insight]
[style:brisk]

[screen: ASSERT]
show: *
active: A, ( A B )
equal: / C A /, / A B /
